{"name":"Bergamot","hex":"#95c703","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bergamot","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A tree of the orange family (Citrus × limon, syn. Citrus bergamia), having a roundish or pear-shaped fruit, from the rind of which an essential oil of delicious odor is extracted, much prized as a perfume.","The fruit from the bergamot tree."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A coarse tapestry, manufactured from flock of cotton or hemp, mixed with ox's or goat's hair."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bergamot"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bergamot orange","blocks":[{"text":"Citrus bergamia, commonly known as the bergamot orange, is a fragrant citrus fruit the size of an orange, with a yellow or green colour similar to a lime, depending on ripeness."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Bergamot_orange_-_whole_and_slice.jpg/330px-Bergamot_orange_-_whole_and_slice.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bergamot_orange","wikidata":"Q109196"},{"title":"Bergamot essential oil","blocks":[{"text":"Bergamot essential oil, is a cold-pressed essential oil produced by cells inside the rind of a bergamot orange fruit. It is a common flavouring and top note in perfumes. The scent of bergamot essential oil is similar to a sweet light orange peel oil with a floral note."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/BergamotEssOil.png/330px-BergamotEssOil.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bergamot_essential_oil","wikidata":"Q488431"},{"title":"Bergamot (arts center)","blocks":[{"text":"Bergamot Station Arts Center is a Santa Monica facility housing many different private art galleries and appears in most tourist guides as a primary cultural destination. Opened September 17, 1994 as Bergamot Station the campus-like complex is owned by the city of Santa Monica and presently managed by the Worthe Group."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5e/Bergamot_Station_Lofts.jpg/330px-Bergamot_Station_Lofts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bergamot_(arts_center)","wikidata":"Q4891432"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Bergamot_orange_-_Cross_section.jpg/500px-Bergamot_orange_-_Cross_section.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Bergamot_orange_-_Cross_section.jpg/1280px-Bergamot_orange_-_Cross_section.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Bergamot_orange_-_Cross_section.jpg/500px-Bergamot_orange_-_Cross_section.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bergamot orange cross section","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABergamot_orange_-_Cross_section.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Melito_di_Porto_Salvo_-_Citrus_bergamia.jpg/500px-Melito_di_Porto_Salvo_-_Citrus_bergamia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Melito_di_Porto_Salvo_-_Citrus_bergamia.jpg/1280px-Melito_di_Porto_Salvo_-_Citrus_bergamia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Melito_di_Porto_Salvo_-_Citrus_bergamia.jpg/500px-Melito_di_Porto_Salvo_-_Citrus_bergamia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bergamot tree in Melito di Porto Salvo, Calabria, Italy","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMelito_di_Porto_Salvo_-_Citrus_bergamia.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb